		<title>From Enablement to Execution, Egypt’s AI Ecosystem Reaches Production Scale</title>
		<link>https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/egypt-africa-ai-ecosystem/</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Fatima Tambajang]]></dc:creator>
